{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "11 - The approval pause",
  "description": "Human-in-the-loop: validation, interrupt(), the approval card, Allow with Changes, and resuming the paused run.",
  "nextTour": "12 - The answer on screen",
